{"title":"Hawaii AMC","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Hawaii participates in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AMC\">AMC</a> each year.  Usually 1 or 2 people qualify for the USA(J)MO.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"USAJMO_Hawaii_Competitors\">USAJMO Hawaii Competitors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_AMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: USAJMO Hawaii Competitors\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>2010: Zhengyuan Ma</li>\n<li>2011: Emile Oshima</li>\n<li>2012: Ethan Vo</li>\n<li>2015: Jesse Doan</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"USAMO_Hawaii_Competitors\">USAMO Hawaii Competitors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_AMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: USAMO Hawaii Competitors\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>2011: Zhengyuan Ma</li>\n<li>2012: Zhengyuan Ma</li>\n<li>2013: Ethan Vo</li>\n<li>2014: Zhengyuan Ma, Ethan Vo</li>\n<li>2016: Koen Komeya</li>\n<li>2017: Jesse Doan</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018090144\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14111:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018090144 and re